                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Standard 52-card pack. Standard poker hand rankings apply.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Standard deck, casino chips, table with betting areas',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Each player and dealer receive 2 hole cards face down. 5 community cards dealt in stages: 3-card flop (face up), turn, river.',
              },
            ],
          },
